WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.902
Correct an error openly Establish the facts and consequences

00:00:05.297 --> 00:00:09.086
inform the appropriate people make the corrected time prominent

00:00:09.139 --> 00:00:13.047
and mark the earlier time superseded Correct the controlled

00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:16.389
programme as well as the message obtain acknowledgement from

00:00:16.494 --> 00:00:17.692
people who must act
